DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The wwppaa__ppaasssspphhrraassee utility is a small program for generating a 256-bit
     pre-shared WPA key from an ASCII passphrase and a given SSID. The output
     is formatted for inclusion in wpa_supplicant.conf(5).

     If wwppaa__ppaasssspphhrraassee is called with only an SSID as argument it will prompt
     for a passphrase on standard input.

